Problematic behaviour
luin@luin ~/4/C/minishell> ./minishell
minishell>$$SHELL
SER=luin/bin/bash

But in bash also
└─$ $$SHELL
1332SHELL: command not found

┌──(luin㉿luin)-[~/42/CC/minishell]
└─$ $$$SHELL
bash: 1332/bin/bash: No such file or directory

Solved:
$$ (Special Parameter): This expands to the process ID (PID) of the shell
